// `Effect::Simultaneous` outside an exchange-family macro's body: the
// engine's simultaneous-batch wiring is exchange-only ([CR#701.12]) until
// it generalizes — load-capped, mirroring the E-BRIDGE-CAP discipline.
Normal(
  name: "Reject Bare Simultaneous",
  types: [Sorcery],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Simultaneous([GainLife(1), LoseLife(1)])),
  ],
)
